OL,3,GNEWSAUnusual Bond and Mamma Mia! props
OL,4,Aup for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FProps used in James Bond films and the
OL,7,Fmusical Mamma Mia! are up for auction
OL,8,Fon Monday.
OL,10,FFor the past 35 years, Living Props in
OL,11,FIver Heath, Buckinghamshire has worked
OL,12,Fon some of the world's best-known films
OL,13,Fand television productions.
OL,15,FThe business, located near Pinewood
OL,16,FStudios, was founded in 1991 by Brian
OL,17,FMaslin, who was later joined by his son
OL,18,FBlake, and Mick Lambert.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
